{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to </strong><i>Spongiorno</i> <strong>\u2013 quite possibly the greatest underwater bubble simulator of all time!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Schwammfred, a spongy moving assistant on a mission:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the eccentric Dr. Octoganapus safely transport his precious moving box into the waiting truck. Push, float, launch, and wrangle an unruly box through an aquarium full of obstacles, currents, and surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866220/extras/5eb70eb6b4cf7109184581bf3b5727c2.poster.avif?t=1763585633\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866220/extras/5eb70eb6b4cf7109184581bf3b5727c2.webm?t=1763585633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866220/extras/5eb70eb6b4cf7109184581bf3b5727c2.mp4?t=1763585633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with your trusty bubble blaster, you'll need to guide the box through various levels. Time is ticking, the environment is unpredictable, and the physics are\u2026 flexible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bubble physics! <br>The heart of the game. Just a really satisfying bubbly feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 challenging underwater levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming visuals.<br>Speaking for themselfs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against time and set new speed records:<br>Leaderboards available for every level!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866220/extras/6a50a9512ea25c1f92bd36ddd1848c17.poster.avif?t=1763585633\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866220/extras/6a50a9512ea25c1f92bd36ddd1848c17.webm?t=1763585633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866220/extras/6a50a9512ea25c1f92bd36ddd1848c17.mp4?t=1763585633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Spongiorno: Spongefred Moving Company</i> combines physics-based gameplay with silly humor and clever puzzles. Can you deliver the cargo?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game idea was born on GlobalGameJam 2025 and I had so much fun with it that I just kept going. I hope you have as much fun playing as I had the last months.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Come to daddy!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866220/6ed6aedb6cf4ff11452e30a36e123932ee5172e9.jpg"},{"name":"Wrong address","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866220/62bdf5dbfbb7a38cc7d5d1bb7ee1eb967c342a0c.jpg"},{"name":"Wait for it!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866220/ee831d5dcbcaf20fcabd86f909a8ada50b489a80.jpg"},{"name":"Huiiiiiiii!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866220/d817efb0cafb06792c642ef8bf27b54ee810b75c.jpg"},{"name":"Aaaaaaaand it's gone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866220/50f9d917a8a32e7afc6a1a9105d48501b36c7603.jpg"},{"name":"Where am I?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866220/c83432fafcf949fc644534bb667f495030d73d37.jpg"},{"name":"Phew!","path":"https://cdn