an unruly box through an aquarium full of obstacles, currents, and surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866220/extras/5eb70eb6b4cf7109184581bf3b5727c2.poster.avif?t=1763585633\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866220/extras/5eb70eb6b4cf7109184581bf3b5727c2.webm?t=1763585633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866220/extras/5eb70eb6b4cf7109184581bf3b5727c2.mp4?t=1763585633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with your trusty bubble blaster, you'll need to guide the box through various levels. Time is ticking, the environment is unpredictable, and the physics are\u2026 flexible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bubble physics! <br>The heart of the game. Just a really satisfying bubbly feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 challenging underwater levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming visuals.<br>Speaking for themselfs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against time and set new speed records:<br>Leaderboards available for every level!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866220/extras/6a50a9512ea25c1f92bd36ddd1848c17.poster.avif?t=1763585633\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866220/extras/6a50a9512ea25c1f92bd36ddd1848c17.webm?t=1763585633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866220/extras/6a50a9512ea25c1f92bd36ddd1848c17.mp4?t=1763585633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Spongiorno: Spongefred Moving Company</i> combines physics-based gameplay with silly humor and clever puzzles. Can you deliver the cargo?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game idea was born on GlobalGameJam 2025 and I had so much fun with it that I just kept going. I hope you have as much fun playing as I had the last months.</p>","developers":["HappyHoppo"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866220/7c5914849a7fcc734afd7f583a9dc2ef3399e9bd/header.jpg?t=1763585633","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3866220/1828929225/58523f458f75c0a53a652dc72ac6103d59df3a47/1756331151/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756418429","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3866220/1828929225/58523f458f75c0a53a652dc72ac6103d59df3a47/1756331151/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756418429","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3866220/1828929225/58523f458f75c0a53a652dc72ac6103d59df3a47/1756331151/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756418429","id":257181855,"name":"Spongiorno","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257181855/42b4ef8c0c29edcec728a9bc0aacddb75cb3e349/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756418429"}],"name":"Spongiorno: Schwammfred Moving Company","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recu